{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09329","headline":"洛都游寓 · 韦应物","name":"洛都游寓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风日已和，元化亮无私。\n草木同时植，生条有高卑。\n罢官守园庐，岂不怀渴饥。\n穷通非所干，局促当何爲。\n佳辰幸可游，亲友亦相追。\n朝从华林宴，暮返东城期。\n掇英出兰臯，翫月步川坻。\n轩冕诚可慕，所忧在絷维。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}